  "body": "Privately positioned down a quiet lane, this beautifully presented home has been thoughtfully designed and built to a high standard, with a practical layout and contemporary finishes throughout. Offering comfort, space and easy living, it's an ideal choice for young families.\r\n\r\nSpread across two levels, the home features:\r\n•Three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master suite complete with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are serviced by a generous family bathroom with a bathtub. \r\n•A handy downstairs powder room for guests.\r\n•Light-filled open-plan living, dining and kitchen space that flow seamlessly onto a sunny deck, ideal for summer entertaining. The well-appointed kitchen features a separate scullery with an additional kitchen sink, walk-in pantry, quality appliances and excellent storage.\r\n•A single internal-access garage with integrated laundry.\r\n•The location is just as appealing, with Macleans Park only a short stroll away and Eastern Beach, Bucklands Beach and Half Moon Bay Marina all within easy reach. \r\n•The property is also zoned for Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, all within walking distance.\r\n\r\nPlease call Wendy and Lawrence to arrange a private appointment.",
